  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Rinse red kidney beans. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook kidney beans and corn, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes. Lightly mash kidney bean mixture with a potato masher or fork.\n• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you’re sensitive to heat. Add MexicanFiesta spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in the water, enchilada sauce and baby spinach leaves until wilted andcombined, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9ff7c80ad488c9bcf551/step-b5790a00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Arrange mini flourtortillas over a lined oven tray. Divide bean mixture amongtortillas, spooning it onto one half of each tortilla, then top with Cheddar cheese.\n• Fold the empty half of each tortilla over to enclose filling, then press down withspatula. Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake quesadillas until cheese has melted and tortillas are golden, 8-10 minutes.Spoon any overflowing filling and cheese back into quesadillas.\n• TIP: Place a sheet of baking paper and a second oven tray on top of the quesadillas if they unfold during cooking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9ff7c80ad488c9bcf551/step-0eed9c10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and roughly chop.\n• Roughly chop tomato and coriander.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, avocado, coriander and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9ff7c80ad488c9bcf551/step-12485720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican kidney bean and corn quesadillas between plates.\n• Top with avo salsa and chipotle mayo to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9ff7c80ad488c9bcf551/step-deef6630.jpg"
    }
  ]
